 ST1   CLA KC+1,1         PICK UP RANK COLUMN ORDER                     IPM20914
       PDX ,2                                                           IPM20915
       TXI *+1,4,MDIM     DECREMENT IS COLUMN LENGTH DIMENSION          IPM20916
       PXD ,4             XR4 CONTAINS CURRENT COLUMN INDEX             IPM20917
